WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.671
On Sunday, we’re sent out to bear fruit that will last.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.600
On Monday, you open for business.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.169
Can believers find you?

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:15.856
Meet Jubilee.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.816
Toronto’s Christian businesses, prospering with purpose.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.500
God gives us the power to get wealth.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.050
Business has always resourced the Kingdom.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.682
And together, we strengthen our city.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.029
Shop with purpose: Bibles, gifts, apparel and fresh flowers.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.577
Hire believers who work as for the Lord,

00:00:39.766 --> 00:00:40.884
and book in a tap.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.200
Own a business? Bear fruit.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:47.728
Prosper with purpose and resource His Kingdom.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.000
Create your page, welcome believers who want to buy from you,

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.400
and resource the Kingdom.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.060
Jubilee. Your business was meant to outlast you.
